# ===== Staff Dashboard PINs =====
# WARNING: These VITE_ values are built into the public JavaScript bundle,
# so anyone can read them. They only hide the UI - they are not real security.
# (See review finding C1: the API needs server-side auth for real protection.)

# PIN to unlock the staff dashboard. Default in code: 1234
VITE_STAFF_PIN=""

# PIN to unlock Manager Mode (analytics, rewards, points). Default in code: 9999
VITE_MANAGER_PIN=""
